# The automap, ported from am_map.c to Flow.
#
# All automap logic lives here: projection math, panning/zoom, the
# Cohen-Sutherland line clipper, Bresenham line drawing into the palette
# framebuffer, walls/players/things/marks/grid drawing and follow mode.
#
# Engine data is reached through GEOM_* / PLAYER_* / KEY_* accessors.
# automapactive and cheat_amap live here (formerly am_shim.c storage).
#
# The only struct read by offset here is event_t (d_event.h), which is
# five plain ints: type, data1, data2, data3, data4.

