# ---- the vector graphics ----------------------------------------------
#
# player_arrow / cheat_player_arrow use R = (8*PLAYERRADIUS)/7 = 1198372;
# thintriangle_guy uses R = FRACUNIT. All values precomputed with C
# integer/truncation semantics. Layout: ax, ay, bx, by per line.

